{"resources":{"results":{"products":[{"available":true,"body":"C2052 hollow pin chain is a 1.25\" pitch oversized roller ANSI double-pitch roller chain with cylindrical open-bearing surface areas where the pins would typically be, allowing for pins or other articles to be affixed through the roller chain. C2052HP hollow pin roller chain is a conveyor-series chain with oversized rollers, meaning that it has straight sidebars that are optimal for conveying components from one point to the next and rollers that extend past the width of the sidebars. The chain rollers are capable of easily rolling on a surface. Our C2052 hollow pin roller chain conforms to ANSI B29.1 dimensional standards for direct interchangeability with different brands and proper sprocket contact. What sets our C2052HP hollow pin chain apart from others is the use of high-precision components that have all been heat-treated and shot-peened for improved strength and fatigue resistance. We also pre-load our C2052 hollow-pin roller chains for perfect hollow-pin alignment and to decrease significantly or eliminate chain elongation over time. C2052 hollow pin chains are used for conveyors, packaging equipment, and more. For additional information or to get a quote, contact our customer service team, and we will gladly assist you!\u003ch3\u003eC2052 Hollow Pin Chain Dimensions\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0633\/0187\/7925\/files\/osr_hollow_pin_roller_chain_dimensions_f2a86b18-83ad-40f5-bfd2-428e85d938b8.jpg?v=1737624635\" alt=\"C2052 Hollow Pin Roller Chain - 10ft Box\" style=\"width: 485px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cul style=\"letter-spacing: normal;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChain Size: C2052HP\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePitch (P): 1.250\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRoller Width (O): 0.375\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRoller Diameter (R): 0.75\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHollow Pin Outside Diameter (L): 0.283\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHoll